        "comments": "The assembly gzMucPiri1.1 is based on 69x PacBio data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project (https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, retained haplotig separation with purge_dups. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using MBG from PacBio HiFi reads mapping to related genomes. A representative sequence was selected for each from the graph based on read coverage, contig size, and its alignments to the related genomes, then MitoHiFi was run on this sequence for circularisation. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using rapid curation. Chromosome-scale scaffolds have been named in order of size.",
